~ convo_0
Fenn: Uhh, [wait=0.3][color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color]?
Wizard: Oh, [wait=0.3][wave freq=7 amp=25]hello.[/wave] I didst not see thee there.
Fenn starry: Whatcha doin?
Wizard grit: [i]Do not mindeth me.[/i] 
Wizard: I am simply observing your [i]futile[/i] efforts.
Fenn: Huh. Okay!
do EventFlags.num_cellar_conversations += 1
=> END

~ convo_1
Fenn: Hey [color="8A0194"]Wizard man[/color], do you like ice cream?
Wizard grit: [wave freq=7 amp=30 connected=0]Woooow.[/wave] Asking the [i]"ice guy"[/i] if he liketh ice cream.[i] [shake level=7 rate=30]Very original.[/shake][/i]
Fenn: Well [wait=0.3]you call me "pint-size," so... do you?
Wizard: [font_size=60]Wha-[/font_size][wait=0.3] [font_size=80][shake level=10 rate=50]NO!![/shake][/font_size]
Wizard grit: Tis a [shake level=7 rate=30 connected=0][i]mockery[/i][/shake] of nature! An [shake level=7 rate=30 connected=0][i]insult[/i][/shake] to all that is cold.
Fenn starry: Are you lactose intolerant?
Wizard grit: [wave freq=10 amp=30]And there thou goes![/wave]
Wizard: Assuming I'm lactose intolerant [wave freq=10 amp=30 connected=0]just because[/wave] I liketh not [i]ice cream![/i]
Fenn starry: Well, are you?
Wizard: [font_size=80][shake level=10 rate=50]Tis besides the point![/shake][/font_size]
Fenn: Huh... no wonder all those ice creams are so mad.
do EventFlags.set_flag("X-Ws-Cellar-1", true)
do EventFlags.num_cellar_conversations += 1
=> END

